{
  "name": "history-range-transition-last",
  "description": "Calendar years that change to week-based years (weeks from Thursday, years starting on the last Thursday on or before 6 January) through a 52-week week_pattern transition, 9998-01-01 to 9998-12-30. The entry's first year runs from 9998-12-31 for 371 days, past 9999-12-30, so the entry's regime has no supported fiscal year and the transition is the last one (number 9998 by 'start'). Year 9999, years to 9999, shift past the transition, locate on 9998-12-31 and a dimension that ends there are OUT_OF_RANGE. Illustrative.",
  "source": {
    "kind": "oracle",
    "citation": "Independent implementation of the spec in conformance/generators/fiscal_oracle.py, written with Python datetime and no fiscalclock code",
    "url": null,
    "checked_by": "fiscal_oracle.py: Calendar.seq built from the regimes and transitions; change_errors and naming_errors pass"
  },
